{{Quote|Turns the user into diamond, enhancing defense and providing sharp attacks.|Shop}}
'''Diamond''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|600,000}} or {{Robux|1,000}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Diamond allows the user to encrust their body with {{w|diamond}}, giving themselves protection, the ability to conjure and manipulate diamonds to attack opponents, and also using their shiny body to reflect light and blind nearby opponents. The user can only use the fruit's attacks while transformed.

