==Overview==
<tabber>
|-|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Cheap and easy to obtain.
* Good for [[sword]]/[[gun]]/[[fighting style]] mains due to [Z]'s defense buff, increasing their survivability.
* Great for grinding and [[Raids|raids]].

|'''[TAP] Normal Attack'''
* Good mobility move.
* Hits multiple enemies when hitting a wall or the ground.
* Can fling the user really far if used correctly

|'''[Z] Encrust'''
* The defense boost is good for tanking [[bosses]], players, and [[Enemies|NPCs]].
* Quick transformation.
* Deals damage while transforming.
* Deals high damage if near a surface.

|'''[X] Shard Storm'''
* Good damage (if all projectiles hit).
* Good stun.

|'''[C] Shimmering Disruption'''
* Large [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Blinds enemies for three seconds, making it a somewhat good combo starter and for running.

|'''[V] Prismatic Reflection'''
* Auto-aims.
* Decent for grinding.
* Decent hitbox.
* Can be deadly in combos if used correctly.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Most moves are close range and difficult to hit by themselves, making them require help from other attacks.
* Not suitable for fighting against teamers.

|'''[TAP] Normal Attack'''
* Bad for grinding.
* Can sometimes fling the player into water, causing the player to die (most likely unintended).
* Easy to dodge.

|'''[Z] Encrust'''
* Low damage.
* Small range.

|'''[X] Shard Storm'''
* Mediocre damage if only a small amount of shards hit.
* If held, the stun can prove a bit rough and can give the enemy a chance to escape.

|'''[C] Shimmering Disruption'''
* Slight startup.
* Not a lot of range if tapped.

|'''[V] Prismatic Reflection'''
* Single target.
* No stun.
* Can be dodged.
* Cannot break [[Instinct]].
}}
</tabber>

==Trivia==
* The {{Ability|TAP}} move is similar to an old move prior to the rework, '''Beaming Tackle'''. 
* All of Diamond's [[skins]] are based off gems and minerals.

